{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871940/extras/2c5f3ea19c1984a1e96604d36857349b.avif?t=1767324423\" width=1200 height=120 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871940/extras/52e2584aaa349a85efc88e6225c6dddb.avif?t=1767324423\" width=1200 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871940/extras/330c4629ea08c3a2d87dcde6952b1b98.poster.avif?t=1767324423\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871940/extras/330c4629ea08c3a2d87dcde6952b1b98.webm?t=1767324423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Still Stars Echo</i> is an atmospheric science-fiction journey across distant alien landscapes. Traverse monolithic structures, solve intricate puzzles, and uncover the story of a lost civilization written among the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871940/extras/8b58f699548d6f9f59e328594feb2e50.avif?t=1767324423\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871940/extras/ede7553489d116a10cfd10a2099dc292.avif?t=1767324423\" width=1200 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871940/extras/85896fb4bb6a27d02ad9407d2858bf1e.avif?t=1767324423\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide an expedition drone through five cinematic chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a story told through alien architecture, ruins, and silent spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level handcrafted, <i>every moment a frame from a film</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871940/extras/6db40ff6401170bff2bede6bba8f0240.avif?t=1767324423\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871940/extras/14c95a4c4d953ba2cf394190460d8e74.avif?t=1767324423\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve unique abstract puzzles woven seamlessly into the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn through experimentation with progressively challenging puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calm experience with no obtrusive instructions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871940/extras/59d8a4752674aa1f2848380d9883e8d3.avif?t=1767324423\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871940/extras/72f5d2607e94d0874c4b96c7e2731ed4.avif?t=1767324423\" width=1200 height=580 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience vast sci-fi worlds, towering monuments, and timeless landscapes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy meditative exploration, free of combat and failure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game camera to capture environments built for awe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871940/extras/b527bb073a6dc48a877beaae734237eb.avif?t=1767324423\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871940/extras/bee255ed089f034290507fc7b9278504.avif?t=1767324423\" width=1200 height=580 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >58 minutes of deeply atmospheric and dynamic original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich analog synths, ethereal ambient textures, and majestic organ tones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best experienced with headphones</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871940/extras/75d5eaabf1e2c2606ceada52a4895109.avif?t=1767324423\" width=1200 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871940/extras/0456e2dc8d02316be5bf04fff068c5f2.avif?t=1767324423\" width=1200 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An experience with a playtime of between one and two hours, every element has been crafted and refined over many years. Perfect to enjoy in a single day, it is our ode to colossal architecture, distant futures, and the remnants of lost civilizations. May you wander it as we once did.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3871940?t=1767324423","b